<title>ITALY: SOCCER-INTER'S FRESI SENT OFF IN UEFA CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INTER'S FRESI SENT OFF IN UEFA CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter's Salvatore Fresi was sent</p>
<p>off in the 90th minute off their UEFA Cup final second leg match</p>
<p>against Schalke of Germany on Wednesday for his second booking</p>
<p>of the match.</p>
</text>
